      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see why a change of the smart pointer type is needed. We would need to use `shared_ptr` if there were a case where another object needs to hold an instance of `ModuleConfig` with a `shared_ptr`. However, I don\u0027t see anything like that in the new code.",
